  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as both a noun and suru verb. In sports, プレイ refers to individual actions or moves (ファインプレイ = great play, ラフプレイ = rough play). In gaming, ゲームをプレイする is the standard expression.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ファインプレイ: fine play, great play\n- フェアプレイ: fair play\n- ラフプレイ: rough play\n- ゲームをプレイする: to play a game\n- プレイヤー: player\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {遊|あそ}ぶ: to play (general, children's play, leisure)\n- {演奏|えんそう}する: to play (music, formal)",
